    "title": "-더니 (I noticed that... and then)",
    "title_ko": "-더니",
    "focus_axis": "grammar"
  },
  "context": {
    "explanation_en": "« -더니 » reports a past observation followed by a result. For example, « 열심히 공부하더니 시험을 잘 봤어요 » (She studied hard, and then did well on the exam).",
    "explanation_ko": "'-더니'는 과거의 관찰 후 결과를 전달합니다. 예: '열심히 공부하더니 시험을 잘 봤어요'.",
    "key_expressions": [
      {
        "en": "She studied hard, and then did well on the exam.",
        "ko": "열심히 공부하더니 시험을 잘 봤어요."
      },
      {
        "en": "It was sunny, and then it suddenly started raining.",
        "ko": "날씨가 좋더니 갑자기 비가 왔어요."
      },
      {
        "en": "He said he was tired, and then he fell asleep.",
        "ko": "피곤하다더니 잠들었어요."
      }
    ]
  },
